==English==
{{wikipedia|lang=en}}

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|peritonaeum}}

===Etymology===
From {{der|en|grc|περί|περί-|around}} + {{m|grc|τόνος||stretch}} + {{m|grc|-αιος||suffix to form an adjective}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|s|peritonea}}

# {{lb|en|anatomy}} In [[mammal]]s, the [[serous membrane]] lining the cavity of the abdomen and that is folded over the [[viscera]].
# {{lb|en|zoology}} In [[animal]]s, the membrane lining the [[coelom]] cavity.

====Derived terms====
{{der3|lang=en|hydroperitoneum|pleuroperitoneum|retroperitoneum|pneumoperitoneum|peritoneal|peritoneally|peritonitis}}

